  (text "NCP114:\nInput Capacitor Selection (CIN)\nIt is recommended to connect at least a 1uF Ceramic X5R\nor X7R capacitor as close as possible to the IN pin of the\ndevice.\nOutput Decoupling (COUT)\nThe NCP114 requires an output capacitor connected as\nclose as possible to the output pin of the regulator. The\nrecommended capacitor value is 1uF and X7R or X5R\ndielectric due to its low capacitance variations over the\nspecified temperature range. It is not recommended to use \ntantalum capacitors on the output due\nto their large ESR. "
    (at 193.04 241.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 084cdb12-ee52-41d9-bd33-c5e7980bd766)
  )
  (text "BOM:" (at 114.3 245.11 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 0f9f67b1-87e9-4885-a464-569562bdf906)
  )
